Wow, what a weekend it has been! The Apsara Festival, Maleny was fantastic! Lots of musical treats, including The Hayden Hack Infusion Band (yes, we are slightly bias), roving acts, glorious views, gardens and delicious food! We had a prime stall position in-between the main stage and the coffee...met lots of keen drumming kids, sold lots of drum & percussion xmas specials and indulged in lots of icecream. Yum!  What a fantastic venue for a music festival, a great start to the festive season ahead! :) [![](/media/2012/12/elijahAPSARA-300x300.jpg "Elijah and his bestfriend Eli @ APSARA Festival")](/media/2012/12/elijahAPSARA.jpg)
